'''''Captives, Behold the Expanse Beyond Light''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Before Their Deaths]].

==Steps==
# Prepare to return the Coreflame of Worldbearing
# Face Lygus
# Face Zandar in the decisive battle for Amphoreus
# Find a way to defeat Zandar
# Return to Exomyth and continue your adventure
# Say goodbye to Hysilens
# Return the Coreflame of Worldbearing
# Return to the "Epistle of Remembrance" and continue the adventure
# Witness the Imperator's great journey from start to finish
# Witness the legacy left by the Imperator
# Return to Exomyth and continue your adventure
# Glimpse the beginning of the next story

